   334
   335 						;Test underflow
   336 						;
   337 						;There is arguably a bug in the base OS where multiplying two numbers
   338 						;where the composite byte exponent is below -65 results in an error
   339 						;even though it is an underflow. For this reason, we avoid using such
   340 						;tiny numbers and use ones big enough to cause underflow without an
   341 						;error.
